'c' Sign
= char (1-byte integer), where Sign is 's' (signed) or 'u' (unsigned)

'i' Sign Bytes
= integer, where Sign is 's' (signed) or 'u' (unsigned)
  and Bytes is size in bytes

'f' Bytes
= floating point, where Bytes is size in bytes

'^' Size Type
= pointer to type Type, where Size is size of the pointer in bytes

'[' IndexType ']' Type
= array of type Type with index type IndexType, which must be range

'{' TotalSize '=' FieldName '@' BitOffset '#' BitSize ':' FieldType
  { ',' FieldName '@' BitOffset '#' BitSize ':' FieldType } '}'
= record or struct or union, where TotalSize is its size in bytes,
  FieldName is the name of the field, BitOffset is the offset in bits
  from structure's origin, BitSize is the size in bits, and FieldType
  is type of the field

'<' EnumName '=' EnumValue { ',' EnumName '=' EnumValue } '>'
= enumeration, where EnumName is the name of each EnumValue

'r' MinValue '..' MaxValue Type
= range based on integral type Type
  with MinValue and MaxValue as limits

'&' Bytes Type
= function returning type Type, where Bytes is size in bytes

'p' Bytes Type
= function parameter of type Type, where Bytes is size in bytes

'F' Bytes Type
= pascal file of type Type, where Bytes is size in bytes

'P' Bytes Type
= procedure parameter of type Type, where Bytes is size in bytes

'S' Bytes Type
= set based on type Type, where Size is size in bytes

's'
= pascal varying string

'v' Bytes
= void type (a sequence of bytes), where Bytes is size in bytes

'R' Rank Type
= Region of rank Rank, whose limits are base on integral type Type
